    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nSince #42370, when enable `conceallevel > 1` and `concealcursor` without `n`, delete line will raise this error:\n```\nDecoration provider \"conceal_line\" (ns=nvim.treesitter.highlighter):\nLua: /usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/highlighter.lua:410: Index out of bounds\nstack traceback:\n\t[C]: in function 'nvim_buf_get_lines'\n\t/usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/highlighter.lua:410: in function 'on_range_impl'\n\t/usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/highlighter.lua:639: in function </usr/share/nvim/runtime/lua/vim/treesitter/highlighter.lua:618>\n``` \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nnvim --clean\n:set ft=markdown\n:set conceallevel=2\n:set concealcursor=\ninsert `[test](test)`\no<esc>dd\n\nerror when delete line\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nNo error should occur.\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nv0.13.0-dev-1988+gfacba8d36b\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nN/A\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nLinux 7.2.11-arch1-1\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nfoot version: 1.28.0\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nfoot-extra\n\n### Installation\n\nAUR",
